===persian===

آنقدر ماندم...
آنقدر شعر گفتم...
آنقدر شعر خواندم...
گونه‌هایت تر شد...
گریه‌ات... در باران... باور شد...
تابستان ۱۳۷۵

===machine===

I stayed so long...
I made so many poems...
I read so many poems...
that your cheeks went wet...
and your weeping... in the rain... became belief...
Summer 1375

===lantern===

I stayed so long,
made so many poems,
read so many poems,
that your cheeks went wet
and your weeping, in the rain, became belief...

Summer 1375

